branch: 98 (pushed)
families: Dialog (incl. AlertDialog), Popover, Accordion
index rows:
| Dialog | Blocks the page with a task the user must finish or dismiss; AlertDialog is the confirm/cancel variant that never closes on outside click | The user must complete or explicitly confirm before carrying on | [dialog.md](dialog.md) |
| Popover | Non-modal floating panel anchored to a trigger for extra information or small controls | The content is secondary and the page behind stays usable | [popover.md](popover.md) |
| Accordion | Sections that show and hide in place behind full-width tertiary trigger rows | An FAQ or long content the user scans before opening; use Tabs when one panel shows at a time | [accordion.md](accordion.md) |
